Subject: CPMS I02B Direction-Aware Generation Data Design

@ [design_uuid] c89a9bd2-87aa-4470-9f7e-e5e4d6075012

& [PublicForms] are feature gated
  + SchemaContractDirection
  + MachineSchemaRootKind
  + SchemaGenerationLimits
  + SchemaResourceAccount
  + DefinitionRecursionClass
  + ContractDefinitionAccount
  + MachineSchemaRootDraft
  + ContractDefinitionUniverse
  + MachineSchemaGenerationContext
  + MachineSchemaGenerationFaultKind and MachineSchemaGenerationFault

& [PureFunctions] are two
  + generate_contract_definition_universe(direction, context)
  + generate_public_procedure_schema_universes(context) returning both direction keys only after both succeed

& [RootAssignments] are closed
  + input prepare input run input verify
  + output base response preparation response

& [CanonicalScalarWriting] delegates scalar spelling and escaping to serde_json
  + object recursion supplies keys in sorted Unicode scalar order
  + arrays retain encounter order
  + compact bytes feed sha256_bytes

& [FingerprintBinding] is complete
  + definition binds profile direction type and normalized bytes
  + root binds profile direction root kind type normalized root and ordered closure
  + universe binds profile direction schemars identity supplied revision exact limits ordered definition fingerprints ordered root fingerprints and aggregate account

& [SourceTouch] is three implementation files
  + crates/cantor_procedure_tool/src/lib.rs
  + new crates/cantor_procedure_tool/src/schema_generation.rs
  + new crates/cantor_procedure_tool/tests/machine_schema_generation.rs

